### 4. `loadStaff` and `staffList` (`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/ChatPage.vue`)

Declaration:

```446:446:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/ChatPage.vue
const staffList        = ref([]);
```

Full `loadStaff`:

```604:618:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/ChatPage.vue
async function loadStaff() {
  try {
    const data = await fetchStaffList(null); // load all branches so cross-branch DM works
    const raw  = Array.isArray(data) ? data : data.data || [];
    staffList.value = raw
      .map((u) => ({
        ...u,
        display_name: u.username || u.Name || u.name || u.account || u.email || `User#${u.id}`,
        role_label: staffRoleLabel(u.role),
      }))
      .filter((u) => Number(u.id) !== myUserId.value);
  } catch (e) {
    console.error('[Chat] loadStaff:', e);
  }
}
```

**Population:** `fetchStaffList(null)` → normalize to `raw` → map enrich → filter out current user → assign to `staffList.value`.

**Errors:** Failures are only logged with `console.error`; there is **no** user-facing message, **no** `staffList` reset in `catch`, and **no** rethrow. So on error, **previous `staffList` content is left unchanged** (if any).

**Empty API:** If `raw` is `[]`, the map yields `[]` and `staffList` becomes empty; the UI then shows “找不到符合的人員” when filtered lists are empty (e.g. `filteredStaffList` / `dm-staff-empty` at 232).

